      ],
      "text": "AI coding agents such as Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Codex, and VS Code connect via Model Context Protocol (MCP) to read annotations and implement fixes; the MCP route is the recommended option, with clipboard copy as an alternative."
    },
