        "slc_a33a8c76c7d4d4f917e7c91d82c8d61c67cf7fd1b90fc3cfab250ef0bd7324ee"
      ],
      "text": "The extension communicates only with a local server on port 3846, which the terms describe as the sole network endpoint for the product besides an optional NPM registry version check."
    },
