  "summary": "The product is a visual feedback tool for web development: users annotate page elements, make design tweaks, and share the results with AI coding agents or teammates. AI coding agents such as Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Codex, and VS Code connect via Model Context Protocol (MCP) to read annotations and implement fixes; the MCP route is the recommended option, with clipboard copy as an alternative.",
